Subject: [PATCH 11/16] feat(web): let the host send key events to a session

`sendKeyboardEvent` is the canvas's own key path (`KeyboardEvent.code`
as scancodes, modifier state kept in sync), exposed on the public API.
A session only takes keys while its canvas has the focus; a host that
routes the keyboard itself, such as one sending the same keys to
several sessions at once, can now hand a session its keys directly.
Nothing changes for hosts that don't call it.
